  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Muangthai Capital Social Loan to Women-Owned Micro, Small, and Medium-Sized Enterprises in Rural Thailand Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will support lending to micro, small, and medium-sized enterprises owned by women (WMSMEs) in rural Thailand. It will also demonstrate Asian Development Bank&apos;s (ADB) catalytic role in mobilizing much-needed financial resources from both public and private capital to boost financial inclusion by reaching the underserved segments in the country.</narrative>
  </description>
